// A run target before a named item is no run target: the linker folds named
// items around one final expression, and refuses an expression anywhere else.
// The lowering reads no root expression yet (#1105), so it refuses the early
// one as a root child that is no declaration.

/// An expression before a definition (#1105).
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment") ]
1;

/// A definition after it.
@[ checks ]
def late = 2;
